  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth4food</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Empower Youth4Food (EY4F) campaign in Vietnam aims to engage and inspire the younger generation to play an active role in shaping the future of agriculture in the country. The two-year campaign, implemented by Nuffic Southeast Asia, focuses on improving the perception of agricultural education and employment, mobilizing the alumni network, and encouraging youth involvement based on innovation and sustainability principles. The initiative addresses the declining enrollment in agricultural majors in Vietnam and seeks to diversify interest by incorporating various fields related to the agricultural value chain. Recognizing the changing landscape of Vietnam&apos;s agricultural sector, the campaign emphasizes the need for professionals skilled in climate-smart agriculture. It draws inspiration from Netherlands alumni in Southeast Asia, involving them as ambassadors to showcase success stories and opportunities in agriculture. The active participation of Vietnam&apos;s alumni in the campaign underscores their commitment to highlighting the appeal and potential of agriculture as a career and a catalyst for regional advancement.</narrative>
  </description>
